    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i’ve just been thinking a lot lately about how everything feels so... heavy. like, if you look at life through a purely logical lens, we're all just participating in this massive, involuntary subscription service. we didn't sign the contract, we're just here, paying rent and staying alive because of habit, not because there's some inherent reason to keep the service active. it feels less like a gift and more like a chore that no one actually asked for.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
